# Reference Latest API Docs

When making changes to any `client.go` file, always use the WebSearch or WebFetch tools to look up the latest official API documentation for the service being called. Verify that endpoints, request/response schemas, authentication methods, and query parameters match the current API spec before writing or modifying code.

- Jira: https://developer.atlassian.com/cloud/jira/platform/rest/v3
- Todoist: https://developer.todoist.com/api/v1/
